# REQUIRES: python-api
# The coupling and the work of the barostat as fields of the Python model
# (D[python-barostat], #275): `Ensemble.barostat_coupling` and `Ensemble.barostat_work` with
# their defaults and types, the refusal of the first-order work under the
# semi-isotropic and the anisotropic coupling with the words of the control
# file, the compressibility of each axis and the keys of the semi-isotropic
# coupling with theirs, `Program.plan["barostat"]`, and the refusal of a work of Trotter
# type at every step; Inputs/python_barostat.py, scenario refusals, which
# needs no device.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_barostat.py %S/Inputs CPU Double mdir %t refusals | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: barostat refusals passed
